%%% note
try の中の read の誤り (ReaderException) は捕まえる。入力の読み取りの誤りとは別の種類 (ADR 105)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import try from dw::Runtime
output application/json
---
{ ok: try(() -> read("{bad", "application/json")).success, n: sizeOf(payload filter ($ > 1)), j: payload joinBy "-", e: isEmpty(payload), r: payload reduce ($ + $$) }
%%% input payload application/json
[1, 2, 3]
%%% output application/json
{
  "ok": false,
  "n": 2,
  "j": "1-2-3",
  "e": false,
  "r": 6
}
